    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya naarangira Abayudaya omunsi Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu nikyo ekigambo Yeremiya eki yagambiirwe hali Abayudaaya boona abaikaraga omunsi Misiri, abaikaraga Migidori, Tahapanihesi, Menfisi n'omunsi eya Pasiroosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati: Akabi koona aka naleetiire Yerusaalemu, n'embuga za Yuda zoona mukakerorra. Murole embuga ezi. Dora hati goona matongo busaho muntu asobora kuziikaramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eki, kikaleetwa ebibi ebi baakozire bankwasa ekiniga, baagenda kucumiikirra obubbaani n'okuheereza embandwa; ezibakaba batamanyire, kandi ezitaramanyirwe inywe na baisenkuru inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu naikaraga nimbatumira abaheereza bange abarangi, nimbagamba nti: ‘ekintu ekinugwa eki inoba mutakikora!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu batahurre, kandi batateho mutima kuhurra, nukwo bakaleka ebibi byabo n'okucumiikirra obubbaani embandwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyowe nukwo kubiihirwa ekiniga kikararra kunyita nayokya embuga za Yuda n'enguudo za Yerusaalemu; byafooka matongo kandi mahamba, nkooku biri na hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga owa Isirairi naakaguza ati: Habwaki mweretera akabi akarukwingana aho ak'okubaihaho omusaija n'omukazi, enkerembe, n'abaana mukahwera kimu omunsi Yuda, hakaburaho n'omu asigaireho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwaki mumbiihiza, nimuramya ebisisani by'embandwa, nimutambira ebyonzira embandwa ez'omunsi enu Misiri, eimwizire kwikaramu, nukwo mukeehebwe, mube kintu ky'okukyenwa, mube kintu ky'okugaywa amahanga goona ag'ensi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweberwe ebibi ebya baisenkuru inywe, abakama ba Yuda, bakazi baabu, ebyanyu inywenka n'ebya bakazi banyu, ebi baakoliire omunsi ya Yuda n'omunguudo eza Yerusaalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nookuhika hati tibakeeteeraga kandi tibakatiinaga tibakakwataga biragiro ebi nabateeriireho n'ebigambo ebi nabagambiire kandi ebi nagambiire baisenkuru inywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga owa Isirairi nikyo arukugambira ati: Hati nu, ninyija kubarwanisa, ndeete akabi mpwerekereze Yuda yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalisigaraho abacwiremu kufurukira Misiri, abo boona ndibamaraho okurugirra harukukirra kimu kuba wa hansi kugarukira harukukirra kimu ekitiinisa, Misiri nuho baligwa, banu baliitwa obulemu, banu baitwe kiihe, baliba kintu ky'okunuga, kintu ky'amahano, kintu ky'okukyenwa, kandi ky'okugaywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo aba Misiri ndibafubira nkooku nafubiire aba Yerusaalemu, mbaise obulemu, kiihe na kagingo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ha bantu ba Yuda abaasigaireho abaizire kwikara Misiri, nukwo habuleho n'omu ow'alitabuka rundi ow'alyomeera rundi ow'aligaruka omunsi ya Yuda ei barukwegomba kugaruka kwikaramu habwokuba tibaligarukayo, okwihaho abasingwa embarwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija boona abaamanyire bakazi baabu nkooku bacumikiriire embandwa obubbaani, n'abakazi abandi abakaba bali aho, ekitebe ekikooto eky'abantu, abantu boona abaikaraga Pasiroosi omunsi Misiri, nubwo baagarukiremu Yeremiya bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekigambo eki otugambiire omu ibara lya MUKAMA titurukwija kukiikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nitwija kukora byona ebi twaraganiize kukora, nitwija kucumikirra omugo w'omwiguru obubbaani, tumuhe n'ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa, nkooku twakakoraga kara koona, itwe na baisenkuru itwe, bakama baitu n'abanyoro baitu ab'omu mbuga eza Yuda, n'omu makuute ga Yerusaalemu; habwokuba omu kasumi ako tukaba twina ebyokulya bingi kandi tukaba tugwagwaine tutarukubona naku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu okuruga twalekiire aho okucumikirra omugo ow'omwiguru obubbaani n'okumuha ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa, ebintu byona bikatuhwaho twahwerekerezibwa obulemu na kiihe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakazi baakaguza bati: “Obu twacumiikirraga omugo ow'omwiguru obubbaani tukamuha n'ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa, baiba-itwe batakiikirize nukwo twamucumbira keeki ezinyakuroho ekisisani kye n'okumuha ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya nubwo yagarukiremu abantu boona abasaija n'abakazi abaamukagwize ekikaguzo eki ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obubbaani obu mwacumiikirraga omu mbuga za Yuda n'omu makuute ga Yerusaalemu inywe, baisenkur-inywe, abakama banyu, abanyoro banyu, n'abantu boona ab'omunsi egi eki MUKAMA atakiijuke? Atakiteekereze? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyaakwongiire kubagumiisiriza kukora ebibi, kandi tiyakwongiire kugumiisiriza ebintu ebibi ebi mwakozire; ensi yanyu nikyo yafookiire itongo kandi ihamba, nikyo yakyeniirwe yaburwa ow'okugiikaramu, nkooku eri hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kikarugiirra ha kusobeza MUKAMA mwayanga kumuhurra, mwalemwa kukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebigambo bye, nukwo kugwerwa akabi nk'ako, akanyakuroho ha kiro kinu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya yagambira abantu boona, okukira muno yagambira abakazi boona ati: “Inywe inywena aba Yuda, abanyakuli omunsi Misiri, muhurre ekigambo kya MUKAMA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati: Basaija inywe na bakazi banyu, eki mwabalize nakanwa kanyu mukikozire n'emikono yanyu, mukagamba muti: ‘Mananukwo tuhikirize eki twaraganiize ngu tulikikora, nukwo okucumikiirra omugo ow'omwiguru obubbaani n'okumuha ebihongwa eby'eby'okunywa.’ Habweki nu, ebi mwaraganiize mubigumye kandi mubihikirize! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki inywe inywena aba Yuda abanyakuli omunsi Misiri, muhurre ekigambo kya MUKAMA. MUKAMA naagamba ati: Ndahiire ibara lyange ery'ekitiinisa, tindigaruka kwikiriza omuntu n'omu hali inywe, obu araabaga naaragaana kurahira ibara lyange naagamba ati: ‘Ndahiire MUKAMA Ruhanga omwomeezi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibaikazaaho eriiso bagwe omu kabi, baitu baleke kutunga obusinge; abantu boona aba Yuda abanyakuli Misiri balihwerekerra baitwe obulemu na kiihe, okuhika boona obu balikahwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abo abake abalitabuka obulemu, nubo baliruga Misiri, bagaruke omunsi ya Yuda; abo boona aba Yuda, abaizire kwikara Misiri nubwo balimanya ekigambo ekyabaire ky'amazima nikyo ekyange rundi ekyabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: Eki, nikyo kiribamanyisa nkooku ndibafubirra omu kiikaro eki, nukwo mumanye ebi nagambire hali inywe nkooku birihikirra, bibarugiremu akabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
