          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: Zedekiya omukama wa Yuda nkooku namulekiire Nebukadeneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni ow'akaba ali munyanzigwa we kandi ayagendaga kumwita, Faraaho Hofura omukama wa Misiri nawe nukwo ndimulekera abanyanzigwa be n'abo abarukwenda kumwita.”",
